# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent / Phalanx loop state — machine-local, never commit.
# See PANOPLY-OPTIMIZATION.md and .agents/rules/documentation.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.claude-state.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude-runs/
.phalanx-*
.work-off
.pipeline-off
.ts-arch-off
.secret-scan-off
TASKS.md
PROGRESS.md
HANDOFF.md
next-session.txt
/progress.md
/progress-v2.md
/HANDOFF-nexalog-v2-phase1-merge.md
.playwright-mcp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Legacy artifact snapshots — machine-local scratch the operator keeps on disk.
# Full ANCHORED paths, never a glob: a bare `*.bak` would swallow any legitimate
# backup file anywhere in the tree. `.claude/
.claude-state.json` and `next-session.txt`
# are already covered by the block above (no duplicates here).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/apps/web/app/(auth)/login/login-form.tsx.bak-plexologin-20260827
/apps/web/app/api/capture/route.legacy.ts.bak

# Build artifacts — binaries do not belong in the repo.
*.zip

# Editor/atomic-write leftovers. A bare `*.tmp` is safe here (unlike `*.bak`, which
# legitimately exists on disk in places): nothing tracked should ever match, and the one
# file that did — a stale single-line copy of apps/web/tsconfig.json, unreferenced since
# the initial release — has been deleted. Anchoring this to a directory would leave the
# same hole one level over.
*.tmp

# Generated tool-native mirrors — canonical source is .agents/ + AGENTS.md.
# Run `sh scripts/sync-agents.sh` to produce the mirrors for the tools you use.
.cursor/
.clinerules/
.windsurf/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
GEMINI.md
CONVENTIONS.md
*.mdc

